37928>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnNavigateForward tWebNavigateData NavigateData Integer hoInvokingView Integer hoInvokingObject
37931>>>>>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oNewButton to True
37932>>>>>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to True
37933>>>>>>>>>
37933>>>>>>>>>        Case Begin
37933>>>>>>>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromParent)
37935>>>>>>>>>                // If from parent, this is a constrained drill down
37935>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
37936>>>>>>>>>
37936>>>>>>>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromChild)
37939>>>>>>>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent lookup from a Zoom
37939>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
37940>>>>>>>>>
37940>>>>>>>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromMain)
37943>>>>>>>>>                // If from main, this is a probably a main-file lookup from a Zoom
37943>>>>>>>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
37944>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
37945>>>>>>>>>
37945>>>>>>>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
37945>>>>>>>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
37945>>>>>>>>>
37945>>>>>>>>>        Case End
37945>>>>>>>>>
37945>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
37946>>>>>>>>>
37946>>>>>>>>>
37946>>>>>>>>>End_Object 
